WEBVTT

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.360
Look at this... It reverted?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.610
Yeah! It's reverted!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.610
Reverted!

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.570
Reverted, reverted! Reverted at last!

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.730
What are you prancing on about?

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:24.520
Read it and weep.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.750
You fool! You finally increased 
the Zebul Spell, and...

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.820
The power will grow the more you 
beat the crap out of your opponents.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.680
Coming ever closer to the 
true power of a Demon Lord!

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.870
Oh, yeah? What was that again?

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.250
See, I'm just your average 
upstanding citizen!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.790
You fiend...

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.460
As long as I stay well behaved, this 
thing goes right back to the way it was!

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.520
Well-behaved?

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.790
I stayed cooped up at home for 
a week playing video games!

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.420
You piece of shit slacker.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:04.300
Everything I gained over the past week, gone!

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.680
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.960
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.730
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.340
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>Toys Have Arrived from the Demon World</b>

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:04.970
Oh no you didn't!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.290
Do you have any idea how 
grand an adventure I had?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.990
Give me back my week of glorious splendor!

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.060
Stop whining.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:16.420
I've brought better toys than that.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.340
Huh? A toy?

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.930
It is a toy from the Demon World which you 
and the master can play with together.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.900
It took quite a while to go and pick it up.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:29.940
Ah, I was wondering where you disappeared 
to. Went back to the Demon World?

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.000
It looks like it needs to be set up.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.160
Hey, don't just stand there. Help.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:39.190
We'll finish it up while 
the master is sleeping.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.320
So, what exactly are we making here?

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.920
This instruction manual 
isn't being very helpful.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.590
I thought it was a simple play room, but...

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:51.320
This is...

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:54.920
What the...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:55.940
Oh, no!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.410
It looks like we're completely trapped.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.660
How can you sound so calm?!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.850
Explain what the hell's going on!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.300
Explain?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.730
What would be the point of explaining 
to a simpleton like you?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.150
Throw me a bone here, damn it!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:16.650
Why?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.230
Why not, huh?!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:29.170
Basically, this is similar to what in 
the human world you call an insect cage.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.760
Insect cage?

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:31.370
Yes.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.270
Let's begin the instructions!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.780
Say that today we're having a family picnic!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:41.650
And suddenly, a rare magical beast appears!

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:45.360
I want to capture it, but I don't 
have any items handy on me!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.800
Doesn't that just, like, always happen?

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.760
Uh, no.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.640
For times like those...

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:55.450
It's the "Portable Magical Beast Capture 
Cage!" No monster can get away!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.110
Portable Magical Beast Capture Cage?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:02.220
So we've been trapped in a cage 
that's for holding magical beasts...

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.180
Yes.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.870
Then how do we get out of here?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.080
Wait.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.550
Furthermore, the opening 
and closing of the cage,

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:13.930
is controlled by key blocks, a children's 
toy that will stir their hearts!

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.340
Key blocks?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.380
Those, I presume.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.290
As they play with the blocks and 
holes, the cage opens and closes.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.650
If you can't solve it, the 
cage will not open, ever!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.630
You can take that feature and shove it!

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.390
Not opening! Not opening! 
I's ain't openin' no how!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.520
And what the hell's with that manual?

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.050
It's makin' fun of me!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:39.690
Therefore, during assembly, make 
sure to stand on the outside (LOL).

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.290
Keep the LOLs to yourself!

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:46.700
Anyway, we must get the 
young master to unlock it.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.110
Are you kiddin' me?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.020
Master!

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:53.120
Hey, Baby Beel!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.040
Wake up already!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.360
Master!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:01.950
He's awake!

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:02.630
Master!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.570
You idiot! Not that direction!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.850
Can he not hear us?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.980
Baby Beel!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.600
He got it!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.150
Yes! It seems he understands!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.980
Master!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.990
What the hell is he doing?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:36.320
Yes Master, excellent! You've realized 
there's a new toy all by yourself!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.420
All right! Now take that block and...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.670
...put it under the bed?!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.280
But it was just a feint!

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.850
Is he stupider than a chimpanzee?

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.440
Master! Please stop that!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.980
You're going to break it!

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:06.400
Are you kiddin' me?

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:10.620
Don't tell me I'm going to 
be stuck in here forever...

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.430
This is...

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.040
To hell with that.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:24.850
No way, no how...

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.170
I'll destroy this thing!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.090
He pulled out magic power despite 
being separated from the master...

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:42.820
Hey, you see that?

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.530
I punched the thing to smithereens!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.010
And the Zebul Spell has 
returned to its former state.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.360
Congratulations, it's a happy ending for all.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.040
What're you so happy about?!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:13.050
<b>We Played Doctor</b>

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.560
<b>Principal</b>

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.430
So you had a grand adventure this past week?

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:26.040
Well, it's less than it was before, anyway.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:30.830
That's because I've been good 
for three days since then.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.730
If you think you can defeat 
me, then go ahead and try!

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:38.290
No matter what attack you use, I...

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:46.840
Hilda-san really doesn't hold back, does she?

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:52.350
That damn woman thinks violence is 
the answer to life's problems...

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.050
You're one to talk.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.450
Anyway, it's finally gone back this much.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:00.360
If I can just stay good 
for another 2-3 days...

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:03.500
This time I'm definitely 
gonna manage it somehow!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:08.190
So therefore, in order to be an 
upstanding citizen, you will assist me.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.690
Has there ever been a case where you've 
gone out and <i>not</i> caused an uproar?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.910
I thought I told you to assist me!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.920
See? You're going on a rampage!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:21.740
Hey!

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:23.990
What's that?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.820
Oh, those are toys from the 
Demon World that I haven't used.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:33.930
I have to bring them with me to 
prevent Baby Beel from getting bored.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.850
A stuffed animal? And 
this is a picture book...

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:44.460
It might be called the "Demon World", but 
children's toys are pretty much the same, huh?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.600
FYI, that's a pop-up book of magical 
beasts and an "Exploding Croaker".

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.660
They seem quite proud of the 
amount of gunpowder used.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.890
How can you sound so calm?!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.580
Well, just thought I'd let you get a 
taste of the crap I've been through.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.120
Oga, you bastard!

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:15.760
And this is the "Fun Playtime 
Explosion Orchestra",

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:18.630
and this is the "Fully Automatic 
Assassination Doll".

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:22.600
Yeah. I think just the names 
disqualify these as toys...

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:23.750
No kidding.

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.970
We'd better return them quick 
before things get weird.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.120
What the...

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.560
What the hell have you done to us?

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:56.340
They won't come off! What's going on?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.460
Let's Play Make-Believe! 
Demon World Doctor Edition!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:08.150
Playing pretend doctors and nurses, 
let's raise a child full of compassion!

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:09.840
In order to be more realistic,

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:15.600
the costumes are permanent unless the one 
playing the role of doctor cures a patient!

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:17.710
Here we go with the 
unwanted features again...

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:23.000
Seriously, they ain't comin' off, no 
way! Takin' em off ain't cool! (LOL)

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.660
I said keep the LOLs to yourself!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.880
Damn it!

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:31.050
Seriously? For the rest of our lives?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.840
Of course not!

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:37.150
But... Baby Beel is the doctor...

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:40.470
That guy's never gonna be 
able to heal any patient...

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.470
What'll we do, Oga?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.070
Hey...

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.010
This is a chance.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.720
Listen up, Furuichi.

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:58.910
This thing spreads the more I 
beat the crap out of people.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.210
Right.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:04.740
Then shouldn't it retract the 
more I go and cure people?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.450
T-That's what you think?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.120
There's no way I can stay good 
for who knows how many days!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.470
I'll take this playtime,

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:14.710
and use it to revert this 
thing in one fell swoop!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.270
Got it, Baby Beel?

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:21.750
Starting now, you're Doctor 
Demon Lord! The Super Doctor!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.880
Now get out there and heal people, damn it!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:35.290
It's not like we even know 
how to use this stuff...

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.270
It's Demon World medicine.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:42.150
You're an idiot, Furuichi. There's no 
reason for us to actually use that stuff.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.480
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.710
This is a school, remember?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.270
You know, I've been wondering 
this for a while now...

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.530
What do the teachers in 
the school actually do?

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:03.260
Shit. I guess we have to use the 
medicine in that box after all.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.600
What're these for?

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:15.980
During the hard days of study for entrance exams, 
unwanted magic power and fatigue can easily build up!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.520
The Demon World has entrance exams?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.310
For times like that, use this: 
"Magic Power Sucky-Suck"

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:26.380
Place it where you want, and amazingly, it 
sucks the unwanted magic power right out of you!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.640
It's not healthy to hold it in!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.640
So it's like, a compress?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:35.100
I don't really get the magic 
power part, but I think so.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:38.610
Calm down, Baby Beel!

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:43.190
Hey...

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.500
Baby Beel!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.770
You kiddin' me?

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:53.810
No, man. I'm serious. These beds 
are the best place to eat lunch.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.040
Oh, crap!

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.560
Perfect, our first patients!

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:10.200
Oh, no!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.200
What have you done?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.540
Don't ask me!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.320
Caution! Caution!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:18.710
If you over flow the magic power capacity...

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:21.230
...it will explode!

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:25.460
And it goes without saying that using it on 
people with high magic power is strictly prohibited!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.840
If you self destruct, your 
friends will all laugh at you!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:33.060
Wait, wait, hold it! Down boy!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.060
We need to search for something we can use fast!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.730
What's this?

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.060
It's an anal probe for magical beasts!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.690
Try using it if your pet 
has stomach problems!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.320
It's not healthy to hold it in!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.700
Do not use on humans!

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:54.470
A-And this is?

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.330
A baby dragon cooling spray!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.020
If you burn yourself, this 
will cool it right down!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.320
It's not healthy to hold it in!

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.000
Ooh, I think we could use this!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.110
But if the dragon gets in a bad mood...

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:10.880
...it'll go wild, and you'll 
be swimming in a sea of fire!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.600
Seriously, what's with the extra features?

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.820
Then how about this?

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:18.630
The Unicorn Syringe!

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:19.960
It'll even pierce through iron!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:20.960
That's deadly!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:21.950
And this?

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.810
Blackened Char X-Ray Machine!

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.070
Blackened Char?

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:28.030
Ass-mask!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.950
Why is it an ass?

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.230
Then what about this?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.950
It's an explosive korobokkur!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.290
One blast, and you're charcoal!

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.020
Use it whenever you have pent up rage!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.860
It's not healthy to hold it in!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:43.460
Great. Another weapon.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.370
Damn it!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.800
There isn't a single useful thing in here...

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.470
So, what'll we do?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.680
In this case, we'll have to wing-it!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.780
Really?

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.740
Let's do it!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.420
It's healin' time!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.900
Too bad, you know?

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:05.730
That's how it's goin' down. 
We'll team up just for now.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.230
I don't like this at all.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.490
This ain't my style either, you know.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.110
But this is a chance that 
might not come again.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:18.120
If we do in Oga right after 
he got Kanzaki and Himekawa...

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.870
Our names will rise straight to the top!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:25.600
Sure. With the four of 
us at once, even Oga...

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.190
Hey, did you hear?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.340
Oga's taken over the nurse's office!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:44.000
Healing burn wounds? More like freezing 
people in solid blocks of ice!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.360
Stop it, Oga!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.700
What was that?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.990
A-Are they frozen?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.740
H-Hey, Shimokawa!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.580
Wait, Baby Beel... It seems to be crying.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.870
This thing didn't have an 
upset stomach to begin with.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.740
G-Good night...

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:20.980
H-Hey!

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.400
What happened, man?

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:27.450
A pink and black nurse... Oga, as a nurse...

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:31.280
A monster bird was crying in pain... 
And a baby was having a ball...

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.700
Come on, Shimokawa...

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:38.570
Yes... I'm sure I'm just hallucinating 
from lack of sleep...

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:48.800
Welcome, good patient!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:49.840
Shimokawa!

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:53.750
Go get 'em, Baby Beel!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.670
S-Shimokawa!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.030
G-Good...

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:08.910
...night.

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.780
Welcome!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.250
Furuichi, hold them down!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.130
What are you doing?

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.790
I'm winging it!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.390
Have at 'em, Baby Beel!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.130
Ryuichi...

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.650
Ryuji...

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.630
Shimokawa...

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:57.880
Keep your "Puwah!"s to yourself!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:02.400
Looks like we got ourselves another patient!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.190
The Sanada Brothers!

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.640
Shimokawa!

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:11.920
A b-bird...

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.470
Don't worry.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:22.130
They're all being treated.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:28.760
Now... Let's cure you!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.700
<b>Principal</b>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.190
Don't!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.220
That's enough experimentation...

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.510
Let's blow everything up!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:49.710
Idiot.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.860
Don't be stupid, man.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.210
Yeah, yeah...

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:55.880
Hey.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.470
What's that thing Baby Beel has on?

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.760
Isn't that some kind of medical device?

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.430
It's Uroboros's Holy Light!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.520
Shine the light on a patient, and amazingly,

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.940
their injuries will be cured, just like that!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.320
Relax, feel better! It's 
not healthy to hold it in!

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.940
Tell us that in the first place!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.750
Damn it, we wasted a hell of a lot of time.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:21.420
Baby Beel!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.920
Face front for me, 'kay?

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:34.330
Congratulations!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.350
All right!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.010
I'm so tired...

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.810
We did it!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.720
Oga!

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:58.520
How dare you!

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:00.300
Ow!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:10.880
<b>Principal</b>

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.790
I thought I'd finally got it to revert...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:23.500
What the hell have you done, you bastard?

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.230
But I didn't do nothin'!

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.220
Good night?

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:39.790
<b>Principal</b>

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.890
You're late.

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:04.290
It looks like you've done well in your 
role as parent to the Demon Lord.

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:09.660
See what I can do when I try?

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:13.990
Isn't that right, Baby Beel?

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.150
What's the matter, Baby Beel?

00:24:06.150 --> 00:24:10.300
It seems that the young Master 
wants a friend of a similar age.

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:12.760
Anyway, how old is Baby Beel?

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.300
It is rude to ask a Demon Lord his age!

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:17.720
For now, hurry to the park.

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:20.570
Seriously?

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.850
Next time on Beelzebub: The Demon 
Lord Makes his Debut at the Park.

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:27.230
By the way, how old are you--?
